    <description>Demo project in a Salesforce demo org, test data only. Agent action: match the customer question against published Return Policy entries (Custom Metadata) by phrase, and return the entry title with the answer plus found/escalate flags the topic obeys. Phrasing the agent cannot match escalates instead of guessing. Supersedes the digest design: flag-driven escalation transfers reliably, self-judged no-match does not (proven in testing).</description>
